coolify:index/applicationGithubApp:Appli.description:
Manages a Coolify application deployed via a GitHub App integration. Coolify verifies repository access during create, so the referenced GitHub App must have installation access to the target repository.

## Example Usage

<!--Start PulumiCodeChooser -->
```typescript
import * as pulumi from "@pulumi/pulumi";
import * as coolify from "@pulumi/coolify";

// Requires an existing coolify_github_app backed by a live GitHub App
// installation that can access the target repository.
const app = new coolify.ApplicationGithubApp("app", {
    name: "my-github-app",
    projectUuid: exampleCoolifyProject.uuid,
    serverUuid: exampleCoolifyServer.uuid,
    githubAppUuid: example.uuid,
    gitRepository: "https://github.com/myorg/myrepo",
    gitBranch: "main",
    buildPack: "nixpacks",
    portsExposes: "3000",
    domains: "https://app.example.com",
});
```
