Manages a service resource on Coolify. A service can be created from the Coolify catalog (using <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`type`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`Type`" pulumi-lang-go="`type`" pulumi-lang-python="`type`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`type`" pulumi-lang-java="`type`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`type`">`type`</span>) or from a custom Docker Compose file (using <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`dockerComposeRaw`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`DockerComposeRaw`" pulumi-lang-go="`dockerComposeRaw`" pulumi-lang-python="`docker_compose_raw`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`dockerComposeRaw`" pulumi-lang-java="`dockerComposeRaw`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`docker_compose_raw`">`dockerComposeRaw`</span>). These two fields are mutually exclusive.

